WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome to the channel.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.500
Today we are building a small garden shed.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.500
First, you will need a flat patch of ground,
some timber and a few hours.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:22.500
Start by marking out the corners with string.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:28.000
Check each diagonal so the frame stays square.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Is the ground level?
If not, dig out the high side.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Now cut the base boards to length.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Screw them down with galvanised screws!

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Then lift the walls into place.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.000
That is all for this part, thanks for watching.
